=== Daily Quotes by Jar of Quotes ===
Tags: quotes, daily quotes, random quotes
Requires at least: 4.6
Tested up to: 4.9
Stable tag: 4.3
Requires PHP: 5.2.4
License: GPLv2 or later
License URI: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html

This plugin enables your website to display daily quotes on sidebars.

== Description ==

This is a plugin to present your website visitors with daily quotes with the choice between text, image or both. This plugin, using a PHP API, is located at https://www.jarofquotes.com/webapi.php. The API outputs a JSON file containing the quote id, author, text, URL and image location. This JSON refreshes with a new quote once a day.

== Installation ==

1. Install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress
3. Use the Settings -> Plugin Name screen to configure the plugin
4. Go to Appearence -> Widgets and search for 'Daily Quotes by Jar of Quotes' widget and place it where you want.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= What language are the quotes in? =

English

= Is there a bandwidth limit? =

No, you can have as many users coming to your website and the plugin will still work.